.TH tkxml n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkxml \- XML tree viewer (optional; requires tDOM)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkxml
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkxml::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows an XML document as a nested tree. Parsing uses the external tDOM package, so
this widget is optional and not loaded by the umbrella. See docs/tkxml.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, xml, tdom
